; The first spell in the game whose rate is set by how the player MOVES rather than by a clock.
;
; BaseDamage is damage per pool tick. BaseCooldown does not gate casts - there are no casts - it
; scales how far apart the pools are laid, so cooldown reduction thickens the trail instead of
; speeding up a timer. BaseRange is unused: the spell has no reach, only a wake.

